     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div vlink=\"#954F72\" link=\"#0563C1\" lang=\"SV\">\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Tahoma;color:#000000;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<div><font size=\"2\">Dear all,</font></div>\r\n<div><font size=\"2\"><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div><font size=\"2\">this looks like right up the alley of the audience of the unmarked and HMecology lists !</font></div>\r\n<div><font size=\"2\"><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div><font size=\"2\">Best regards  -- Marc</font></div>\r\n<div><font size=\"2\"><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;font-size:16px\">\r\n<hr>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Tahoma\" color=\"#000000\"><b>From:</b> Tord Snäll [<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Tord....@slu.se</a>]<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> 04 June 2020 15:36<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> Tord Snäll<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Postdoc: Modelling, predicting metacommunity dynamics<br>\r\n</font><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Dear all,</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">I would appreciate help to spread the ad for this postdoc position. (Sorry for post-crossing.)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Modelling and predicting metacommunity dynamics</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Duties:\r\n</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">You will develop models for spatial metacommunity dynamics of epiphytes or deadwood fungi. We have extensive data on the colonization-extinction dynamics of most metacommunity members in both study systems. The modelling will\r\n test for effects of environmental conditions, species interactions, species traits and phylogenies. There is also possibility to do fieldwork. Finally, you will make projections of metacommunity dynamics assuming scenarios. We study how socio-economic policy,\r\n climate change or forest management on different spatial scales (global, EU, landscape) may affect the future delivery of ecosystem services and metacommunity structure of different organism groups. The work is funded by The Swedish Research Council and by\r\n Formas.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><a href=\"https://www.slu.se/en/about-slu/work-at-slu/jobs-vacancies/?rmpage=job&amp;rmjob=3761&amp;rmlang=UK\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.slu.se/en/about-slu/work-at-slu/jobs-vacancies/?rmpage%3Djob%26rmjob%3D3761%26rmlang%3DUK&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792450496871000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Rj2WyCQf-hei-50nt4H1b\">https://www.slu.se/en/about-slu/work-at-slu/jobs-vacancies/?rmpage=job&amp;rmjob=3761&amp;rmlang=UK</a></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Best regards,<br>\r\nTord</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\" lang=\"EN-GB\">--<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Tord Snäll<br>\r\nProfessor</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Sveriges lantbruksuniversitet<br>\r\nSwedish University of Agricultural Sciences</span></b><span lang=\"EN-GB\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">SLU ArtDatabanken/SLU Swedish Species Information Centre</span><span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">Box 7007, SE-750 07 Uppsala</span><span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">Besöksadress: Almas allé 8E\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">Telefon: <a href=\"tel:+46%2018%2067%2026%2012\" value=\"+4618672612\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+46(0)18-67 26 12</a>, Mobil: <a href=\"tel:+46%2076%20766%2026%2012\" value=\"+46767662612\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+46(0)76-766 26 12</a></span><span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://www.slu.se/artdatabanken\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.slu.se/artdatabanken&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792450496871000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2QKRrZKeuwNoTEpW6apIjj\"><span style=\"color:blue\">www.slu.se/artdatabanken</span></a></span><span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://www.slu.se/artdatabanken/tordsnall\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.slu.se/artdatabanken/tordsnall&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792450496871000&amp;usg=AOvVaw03eenWPkJjaK7BfKxbN9EZ\"><span style=\"color:blue\">www.slu.se/artdatabanken/tordsnall</span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red;background:white\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>---<br>\r\nNär du skickar e-post till SLU så innebär detta att SLU behandlar dina personuppgifter. För att läsa mer om hur detta går till, klicka\r\n<a href=\"https://www.slu.se/om-slu/kontakta-slu/personuppgifter/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https: